# Issue #61 endpoint-capture data-plane Spike — build + runtime output.
# Authored source is kept and versioned:
#   harness/src/**  (incl. harness/src/bin/{cp3-context,cp6-harness,cp7-harness}.rs),
#   probe/src/**, probe6/src/**, probe7/src/**, each build.rs, every Cargo.toml +
#   Cargo.lock, README.md, this .gitignore.
# Everything below is regenerable, runtime, or physical-run output and is
# never versioned.
target/
runtime/
runtime-cp6/
runtime-cp7a/
evidence/
*.log
*.ndjson
# Generated executables / debug info (the WinPE probes are rebuilt from source
# and staged into the lab SMB share, never committed).
*.exe
*.pdb
# Lab certificate / credential / key material must never be committed.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.der
*.pkcs8
